      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Здрасте.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello.' Nastya offers a simple, somewhat tense greeting as she arrives.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Это твоя вечеринка?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is this your party?' Vika immediately questions the nature of the gathering, sounding defensive.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Ты сказал, её не будет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You said she would not be here.' Nastya points out a discrepancy in what they were told.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Как может меня не быть дома?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How can I not be at home?' Vika defends her presence in her own residence with a rhetorical question.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Зачем ты их привёл?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why did you bring them?' She then turns her frustration on Max, demanding an explanation.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Почему ты не предупредил нас?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why did you not warn us?' Nastya echoes the sentiment, asking why they were kept in the dark.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Вы бы никогда не пришли.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You would never have come.' Max defends his actions, stating a blunt truth about their reluctance.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Вы мои друзья.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are my friends.' He emphasizes their bond to justify his extreme measures.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Я хотел отметить день рождения вместе.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I wanted to celebrate the birthday together.' Max explains his core motivation for the entire setup.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Можете не волноваться.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You do not have to worry.' He tries to de-escalate the tension, telling them to relax.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Спасибо за прекрасный вечер.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you for a lovely evening.' Max offers a sarcastic token of gratitude as the situation falls apart.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Пока.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Bye.' He delivers a final, abrupt farewell.",
